#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/expodo_account_reconcile/wizard/reconcile_wizard.py:0
msgid "Writing off the difference needs both an account and a journal."
msgstr "Passer l'écart en charge exige un compte et un journal."

#. module: expodo_account_reconcile
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/expodo_account_reconcile/wizard/reconcile_wizard.py:0
